       written statement of Gross Revenue for that quarter.
   (c) Records and audit. You keep accurate records of Gross Revenue for at
       least three (3) years and allow the Licensor, on reasonable notice and
       at most once per year, to have them inspected by an independent
       accountant. If an inspection shows an underpayment of more than five
       percent (5%), you pay the shortfall plus the cost of the inspection.
